  << /ActualText (That end\055to\055end span means designs ship as intended\054 without translation loss between design and engineering\056 It also lets me sit comfortably on either side of a handoff \204 writing the spec or consuming it\054 and debugging UI issues in Angular\054 React\054 and Vue codebases when the build diverges from the design\056)
